# Temperance marker — harness gates the publish
- date: 2026-11-05
- branch: fix/harness-gates-publish
- scope-decision: Right thing — run the package before the gate, so a broken
  tarball stops rather than ships. Right way — one step at the end of job 1,
  reusing the harness repaired in the parent PR, local scenario only.
- blast-radius: the publish path. Mitigated by position — the step is last in
  job 1, so every cheap check fails first, and job 2 is untouched.
- verification: YAML parses; the harness step is last in checks; publish still
  declares needs: checks and environment: npm-publish. Full proof needs a
  real release.
- drift-trigger: If this branch starts reconciling ADR-004's drifted step list
  or editing job 2, stop. Both are separate changes.
